### Flame Fist

Activation: As an Attack and Support action, Higuchi may make a TN 1 Martial Arts [Unarmed] (Fire) check to empower her unarmed blows. When she performs this action, she may choose a character at range 0–1 as the target for the burst effect. Enhancement Effect: While this kihō is active, treat the deadliness of Higuchi's unarmed punch and kick profiles as increased by 5 and treat her damage type as supernatural.

Burst Effect: If Higuchi has two or more bonus successes, her target suffers 5 physical damage and must succeed on a TN 4 Fitness check (Air 5, Water 2) or suffer the Dazed condition.

When performing an Attack action check, Higuchi may spend 🎋 as follows:

> **ADVANTAGES / DISADVANTAGES (Kotone)**
>
