As tea master, Kotone has the right to speak the first word. During intrigue conflict scenes, characters who act before Kotone in initiative must forfeit 3 honor before starting their turn. They may choose instead to delay their turn to the end of the current initiative order.

As a Scheme action, Kotone may require any number of characters in the scene to make a TN 3 Courtesy (Air) or Performance (Air) check. Each character who fails increases the TN of their next check targeting Kotone by 1.

> **ADVANTAGES / DISADVANTAGES (Haya)**
>
> Steadfast Oaths: Social; Interpersonal Killer Instinct: Martial; Mental
> Implacable Boredom: Social; Interpersonal, Mental

