### Additional Notes

## Legend of the Five Rings ROLEPLAYING

### CHILDREN OF THE FIVE WINDS

#### The Essential Guide to the Burning Sands

Long ago, the peoples that would become the forebears of the Great Clans worked under the guidance of the divine children, the Kami, to carve out their place in a blossoming Rokugan. The fledgling Unicorn, a group led by the fierce and wise Lady Shinjo, made the ultimate sacrifice to serve the Empire—they left everything behind to discover what marvels and dangers existed in the unfamiliar lands beyond the safety of the only home they had ever known. Centuries passed and the Great Clans had long thought the wild Unicorn Clan lost…but then, they returned…

Children of the Five Winds tells the story of the five families of the Unicorn Clan and their struggles to find belonging in an Empire that in many ways considers them outsiders. Follow the Sand Road and discover the cultures of the Ujik and the Qamarist Caliphate, and how they have influenced the perspective of the Unicorn.

This sourcebook for the Legend of the Five Rings Roleplaying Game includes:
